      "category": "Text",
      "text": "RESOLVED, that the Commission shall have authority to examine,\ncopy or remove any document or other record prepared, maintained\nor held by the City School District of the City of New York,\nincluding the Board of Education, the Chancellor, Community School\nBoards, Community Superintendents and any other officer or employee\nof the school district, except those documents or other records which\ncannot be so disclosed according to law, it being understood that\ncopies shall be made of any original documents to be removed by\nthe Commission.",
